\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The verifier's operating curve on all 437 clean rows, pair-level labels, three checkpoints averaged. ``fix/brk'' counts items the verifier decides correctly and the filter does not, and the reverse; $p$ is McNemar with continuity correction. \textbf  {These $p$-values are a sweep, not eight tests we are entitled to read individually}---we report the column so the shape is visible, and rest no claim on any cell of it. The two italicised rows are significant \emph  {against} us: past $\tau = 0.75$ recall has collapsed far enough that the filter is the better decision rule.\relax }}{5}{table.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:curve}{{3}{5}{The verifier's operating curve on all 437 clean rows, pair-level labels, three checkpoints averaged. ``fix/brk'' counts items the verifier decides correctly and the filter does not, and the reverse; $p$ is McNemar with continuity correction. \textbf {These $p$-values are a sweep, not eight tests we are entitled to read individually}---we report the column so the shape is visible, and rest no claim on any cell of it. The two italicised rows are significant \emph {against} us: past $\tau = 0.75$ recall has collapsed far enough that the filter is the better decision rule.\relax }{table.caption.15}{}}
