\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Precision against recall on \textsc  {Biotx100} at the triple level (three checkpoints, probabilities averaged). The dashed curve is the per-component oracle bound $65r/(65r+16)$ of \S  \ref  {sec:decomp}: a verifier with perfect knowledge of both taxa and the relation still admits all 16 pair-binding failures at every operating point. The deployed filter falls below it. The point of the figure is that the verifier is a curve where the filter is a point; the headline numbers in Table~\ref  {tab:curve} are pair-level on all 437 rows.\relax }}{6}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:curve}{{2}{6}{Precision against recall on \textsc {Biotx100} at the triple level (three checkpoints, probabilities averaged). The dashed curve is the per-component oracle bound $65r/(65r+16)$ of \S \ref {sec:decomp}: a verifier with perfect knowledge of both taxa and the relation still admits all 16 pair-binding failures at every operating point. The deployed filter falls below it. The point of the figure is that the verifier is a curve where the filter is a point; the headline numbers in Table~\ref {tab:curve} are pair-level on all 437 rows.\relax }{figure.caption.14}{}}
